                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg739">p. 739</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d395-f3" n="3" xml:id="d395-f3-content">
                <p>With respect to further comments by the Embassy in Syria on circular telegram 2
                    of July 2, see telegram 26 from Damascus, July 14, <ref target="#pg770">p.
                        770</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
